{"id":"kolu-root","ord":"a0","title":"kolu — the terminal fleet","desc":"The project folder for github.com/juspay/kolu (local clone ~/code/kolu). Kolu lanes ride KOLU's own process (the ruling on Supervision's kolu-pr-process node): the author runs /be instead of our review round and /ci once at done; both platforms green before merge; the drishti pair opens whenever package exports change. Historical kolu lanes (dock-row, consumer-exports) live under the olai project's terminal-door item, where they were children of olai work.","created":"2026-08-28T16:52:15-04:00"}
